Zellij themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

1. Copy the theme file to your Zellij themes directory:
   ```bash
   # Find your config directory
   zellij setup --check

   # Copy the theme (example for Linux/macOS)
{% for v in variants %}   cp {{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.kdl ~/.config/zellij/themes/
{% if not loop.last %}   # or
{% endif %}{% endfor %}   ```

2. Add to your Zellij config (`~/.config/zellij/config.kdl`):
   ```kdl
{% for v in variants %}   theme "{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}"
{% if not loop.last %}   // or
{% endif %}{% endfor %}   ```

